{"seq":2,"slug":"compensation-structure","title":"Figure AI 薪酬结构：硅谷顶级待遇与估值膨胀的股权价值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/figure-ai/level-and-compensation/compensation-structure","wordCount":1634,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"figure-ai-薪酬结构-硅谷顶级待遇与估值膨胀的股权价值\">Figure AI 薪酬结构：硅谷顶级待遇与估值膨胀的股权价值</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Figure AI 的薪酬体系建立在一条信念上：<strong>在人才极度稀缺的领域，薪酬不是成本，而是投资回报率最高的支出</strong>。其结构特征是大比例期权 + 竞争性基薪 + 里程碑挂钩奖金，把个人利益与公司成功直接绑定。</p>\n<p>理解这套体系需要抓住三个变量及其交互：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变量</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>总薪酬结构</td>\n<td>基薪 30-40%、期权 45-55%、签约与年终奖各 5-10%</td>\n<td>期权成为总薪酬的最大组成部分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>估值膨胀</td>\n<td>19 个月估值增长 15.2 倍</td>\n<td>早期员工的期权纸面价值被极大放大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收购事件</td>\n<td>2026 年 OpenAI 以 $29 亿收购</td>\n<td>早期员工受益，后期员工可能面临&quot;水下期权&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这套结构同时承担文化功能：高基薪降低财务焦虑、大比例期权绑定长期利益、里程碑奖金强化 Demo 驱动文化、市场对标消除&quot;外面给更多&quot;的心理。需要注意的权衡是，估值膨胀带来的财富效应是双刃的——它既是最强的人才磁铁，也在估值回落时转化为期权风险。</p>\n<h2 id=\"薪酬概览\">薪酬概览</h2><p>Figure AI 提供硅谷机器人/AI 领域最具竞争力的薪酬包之一。根据 Levels.fyi 等薪酬数据平台的验证数据，其软件工程师的中位数总薪酬达到 $370,000/年，显著高于行业平均水平。</p>\n<h3 id=\"总薪酬构成\">总薪酬构成</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组成部分</th>\n<th>典型比例</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基本薪资</td>\n<td>30-40%</td>\n<td>现金底薪，月付</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>股票期权</td>\n<td>45-55%</td>\n<td>四年归属，逐年 25%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>签约奖金</td>\n<td>5-10%</td>\n<td>入职一次性发放</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>年度奖金</td>\n<td>5-10%</td>\n<td>与里程碑挂钩</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"各岗位薪酬范围\">各岗位薪酬范围</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>岗位</th>\n<th>基本薪资范围</th>\n<th>总薪酬（含期权）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Software Engineer</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>150</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">150K-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">150</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>220K</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>300</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">300K-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">300</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>450K</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Senior Software Engineer</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>180</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">180K-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">180</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>260K</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>400</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">400K-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">400</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>600K</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ML/AI Research Scientist</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>180</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">180K-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">180</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>280K</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>400</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">400K-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">400</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>700K</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Solution Architect</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>200</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">200K-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>280K</td>\n<td>$391K（中位数）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mechanical Engineer</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>140</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">140K-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">140</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>200K</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>280</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">280K-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">280</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>400K</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hardware Engineer</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>150</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">150K-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">150</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>220K</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>300</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">300K-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">300</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>450K</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Product Manager</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>160</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">160K-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">160</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>240K</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>350</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">350K-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">350</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>500K</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"与行业对比\">与行业对比</h2><h3 id=\"figure-ai-vs-行业平均\">Figure AI vs 行业平均</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph Figure AI 软件工程师&#10;        A[中位数总薪酬&lt;br/&gt;$370K]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph 行业 AI 工程师&#10;        B[BLS 中位数基薪&lt;br/&gt;$145K]&#10;        C[Glassdoor 中位数&lt;br/&gt;$134K]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph 入门级 AI 工程师&#10;        D[基薪范围&lt;br/&gt;$95K-$120K]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph Figure AI 软件工程师\n        A[中位数总薪酬&lt;br/&gt;$370K]\n    end\n\n    subgraph 行业 AI 工程师\n        B[BLS 中位数基薪&lt;br/&gt;$145K]\n        C[Glassdoor 中位数&lt;br/&gt;$134K]\n    end\n\n    subgraph 入门级 AI 工程师\n        D[基薪范围&lt;br/&gt;$95K-$120K]\n    end</pre><p><strong>Figure AI 软件工程师总薪酬是行业 AI 工程师基薪中位数的 2.5-2.7 倍。</strong></p>\n<h3 id=\"高薪的原因\">高薪的原因</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>人才稀缺</strong> — AI + 机器人交叉人才全球不足万人</li>\n<li><strong>估值溢价</strong> — 高估值使期权更具吸引力</li>\n<li><strong>竞争压力</strong> — 与 Tesla、Google DeepMind、Boston Dynamics 抢同一批人</li>\n<li><strong>使命溢价</strong> — 顶尖人才可以在大厂赚更多，但为使命选择 Figure</li>\n<li><strong>全栈需求</strong> — 同时需要 AI、控制、机械、电气等跨领域能力</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"期权与股权\">期权与股权</h2><h3 id=\"期权结构\">期权结构</h3><p>Figure AI 作为私人公司，主要通过 ISO（Incentive Stock Options）和 NSO（Non-Qualified Stock Options）向员工发放股权激励。</p>\n<p><strong>标准条款：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>四年归属期（4-year vesting）</li>\n<li>一年悬崖期（1-year cliff）</li>\n<li>每月线性归属（after cliff）</li>\n<li>行权价格 = 入职时 409A 估值对应的每股价格</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"估值膨胀带来的财富效应\">估值膨胀带来的财富效应</h3><p>Figure AI 的估值在 19 个月内从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>26</mn><mtext>亿增长到</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">26 亿增长到</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">26</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">亿增长到</span></span></span></span></span>395 亿（15.2 倍），这意味着：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>入职时间</th>\n<th>入职估值</th>\n<th>当前估值</th>\n<th>期权增值倍数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>2023 年中</td>\n<td>$5 亿</td>\n<td>$395 亿</td>\n<td>~79x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2024 年初</td>\n<td>$26 亿</td>\n<td>$395 亿</td>\n<td>~15x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2025 年中</td>\n<td>$200 亿（估）</td>\n<td>$395 亿</td>\n<td>~2x</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>案例计算：</strong>\n假设一位 2024 年初加入的 Senior Engineer 获得 0.01% 股份：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>入职时价值：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>26</mn><mtext>亿</mtext><mo>×</mo><mn>0.01</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">26 亿 × 0.01% =</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">26</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">亿</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.01</span></span></span></span></span>260,000</li>\n<li>C 轮后价值：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>395</mn><mtext>亿</mtext><mo>×</mo><mn>0.01</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">395 亿 × 0.01% =</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">395</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">亿</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.01</span></span></span></span></span>3,950,000</li>\n<li><strong>纸面增值：$3,690,000</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"openai-收购对期权的影响\">OpenAI 收购对期权的影响</h3><p>2026 年 5 月 OpenAI 以 $29 亿收购 Figure AI，这对员工期权意味着：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>早期员工（2022-2023 加入）的期权可能以 $29 亿估值变现</li>\n<li>后期员工（2025 后加入，行权价基于 $395 亿估值）可能面临&quot;水下期权&quot;</li>\n<li>具体条款取决于收购结构（全现金/换股/混合）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"薪酬哲学\">薪酬哲学</h2><h3 id=\"付高薪的逻辑\">付高薪的逻辑</h3><p>Brett Adcock 的薪酬哲学：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>在人才极度稀缺的领域，薪酬不是成本，而是投资回报率最高的支出。一个顶尖工程师的产出可能是普通工程师的 10 倍。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"薪酬与文化的关系\">薪酬与文化的关系</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>薪酬策略</th>\n<th>文化效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>高基薪</td>\n<td>降低财务焦虑，让人专注工作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大比例期权</td>\n<td>将个人利益与公司成功绑定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>里程碑奖金</td>\n<td>强化 Demo 驱动文化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>市场对标</td>\n<td>消除&quot;外面给更多&quot;的心理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"与竞争对手的薪酬竞争\">与竞争对手的薪酬竞争</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>公司</th>\n<th>同级别总薪酬</th>\n<th>Figure 竞争策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Google DeepMind</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>400</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">400K-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">400</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>800K</td>\n<td>用使命 + 成长潜力对标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tesla（Optimus）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>250</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">250K-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">250</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>500K</td>\n<td>现金 + 期权双高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Boston Dynamics</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>200</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">200K-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>400K</td>\n<td>全方位薪酬优势</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中国机器人公司</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>80</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">80K-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>200K</td>\n<td>不直接竞争</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"福利与额外待遇\">福利与额外待遇</h2><h3 id=\"标准福利包\">标准福利包</h3><ul>\n<li>医疗/牙科/视力保险（公司全额承担）</li>\n<li>401(k) 退休计划</li>\n<li>无限 PTO（实际使用受文化影响）</li>\n<li>免费午餐和晚餐</li>\n<li>通勤补贴</li>\n<li>继续教育补贴</li>\n<li>新员工搬迁补助</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"隐性福利\">隐性福利</h3><ul>\n<li>接触世界最前沿的 AI + 机器人技术</li>\n<li>与顶尖人才共事的学习机会</li>\n<li>个人品牌建设（&quot;曾在 Figure AI 工作&quot;的简历价值）</li>\n<li>潜在的 IPO/收购财务回报</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"薪酬谈判建议\">薪酬谈判建议</h2><h3 id=\"对候选人的建议\">对候选人的建议</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>了解自己的市场价值</strong> — 用 Levels.fyi 对标同级别同地区</li>\n<li><strong>关注总薪酬</strong> — 不要只看基薪，期权可能占总薪酬 50%+</li>\n<li><strong>评估期权价值</strong> — 考虑行权价、估值预期、流动性事件时间线</li>\n<li><strong>谈判窗口</strong> — 创业公司在 offer 阶段谈判空间通常大于大厂</li>\n<li><strong>考虑时机</strong> — 越早加入，行权价越低，潜在回报越大</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>薪酬哲学是投资而非成本</strong>：顶尖工程师的产出可能是普通工程师的 10 倍，因此付高薪是理性选择。</li>\n<li><strong>期权是总薪酬的主体</strong>：占比 45-55%，四年归属 + 一年悬崖，行权价锚定入职时的 409A 估值。</li>\n<li><strong>估值膨胀创造财富效应也带来风险</strong>：早期员工期权增值数十倍，后期员工在收购后可能面临水下期权。</li>\n<li><strong>薪酬承担文化功能</strong>：高基薪、大比例期权、里程碑奖金与市场对标分别服务于专注、绑定、Demo 驱动与心理公平。</li>\n<li><strong>谈判的关键变量是时机与总包认知</strong>：关注总薪酬而非仅基薪，评估行权价、估值预期与流动性事件时间线。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Figure AI 薪酬结构：硅谷顶级待遇与估值膨胀的股权价值","id":"figure-ai-薪酬结构-硅谷顶级待遇与估值膨胀的股权价值"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"薪酬概览","id":"薪酬概览"},{"level":3,"text":"总薪酬构成","id":"总薪酬构成"},{"level":3,"text":"各岗位薪酬范围","id":"各岗位薪酬范围"},{"level":2,"text":"与行业对比","id":"与行业对比"},{"level":3,"text":"Figure AI vs 行业平均","id":"figure-ai-vs-行业平均"},{"level":3,"text":"高薪的原因","id":"高薪的原因"},{"level":2,"text":"期权与股权","id":"期权与股权"},{"level":3,"text":"期权结构","id":"期权结构"},{"level":3,"text":"估值膨胀带来的财富效应","id":"估值膨胀带来的财富效应"},{"level":3,"text":"OpenAI 收购对期权的影响","id":"openai-收购对期权的影响"},{"level":2,"text":"薪酬哲学","id":"薪酬哲学"},{"level":3,"text":"付高薪的逻辑","id":"付高薪的逻辑"},{"level":3,"text":"薪酬与文化的关系","id":"薪酬与文化的关系"},{"level":3,"text":"与竞争对手的薪酬竞争","id":"与竞争对手的薪酬竞争"},{"level":2,"text":"福利与额外待遇","id":"福利与额外待遇"},{"level":3,"text":"标准福利包","id":"标准福利包"},{"level":3,"text":"隐性福利","id":"隐性福利"},{"level":2,"text":"薪酬谈判建议","id":"薪酬谈判建议"},{"level":3,"text":"对候选人的建议","id":"对候选人的建议"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Figure AI 职级体系：超高速增长中的扁平组织","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/figure-ai/level-and-compensation/career-level-system"},"next":{"title":"Figure AI 绩效考核：Demo 驱动的极速评估体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/figure-ai/level-and-compensation/performance-evaluation"}}